{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unleash the Future: Robo Tennis\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Description:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into the fast-paced world of Robo Tennis!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against elite robots from top constructors in adrenaline-pumping tournaments. Earn credits, unlock advanced tech, and build the ultimate robot athlete. Customize your robot\u2019s attributes for peak performance and dominate the pitch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322930/extras/RT_Play_gif_TwitX.gif?t=1744703384\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock New Technologies</strong>: Spend your winnings on cutting-edge parts, upgrades, and special shots to enhance your robot\u2019s abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build Your Ultimate Robot</strong>: Choose from a variety of components and special shots at your factory HQ to assemble a winning machine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Secure Sponsorships</strong>: Win matches to attract sponsors, earn cash, and deck out your robot in their colors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Acquire Trophies</strong>: Prove your prowess by winning major tournaments and earning trophies for your office. But beware\u2014losing big games means losing those precious trophies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the revolution and become the ultimate robo-champion!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322930/extras/RT_Build_gif_TwitX.gif?t=1744703384\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3322930?t=1744703384","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steam